\n・愛央：れな子\n・こころ：紫陽花\n・伶那：紗月\n・勇希：香穂\nがキャラのタイプ的に一番近いです。\n愛央は上記イラストのれな子同様、顔を赤らめて「これってどういう状況！？」的な表情でお願いします。\n\n身長・体格の比較はこちらのページがわかりやすいです。\nhttps://bluereflection-tie.com/dlc.html\n\nまた、今回が良ければ今後残りのキャラの追加を別途リクエストする可能性もあります。\n\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@satomoriumi/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3889079, "client_id": 3907389, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=964127c681dda9f290256b9c4b24bd94", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=964127c681dda9f290256b9c4b24bd94, https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97c59048e17cffafdd4736843dbccf36 2x, https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fad672afe039c3671a834cd0e86eba9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c92b4f2401e8611c1dc35dbf88645a9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6c92b4f2401e8611c1dc35dbf88645a9, https://si.imgix.net/814dc6ef/uploads/origins/a97bf77e-151a-42fc-8d70-6e2b7b8b45f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=