tion!\n\nPlease choose 1 fox girl to illustrate. \n\nBlue: cool blue and stoic girl.\n\nRed:  cold girl, but she can become passionate. Tsundere-type. \n\nGreen: noble daughter, amateur novelist, no friends.\n\nGold: heroine-type girl, cheat skill character. Gives unconditional love.\n\nBlack: noble daughter, commander girl. Gives conditional love only.\n\nWhite: stoic genius mage. Cares more for self. Star magician.\n\nPink: chaotic bright miko. Cares more for others. Rainbow dancer.\n\nSilver:  overworked holy sister. Flawless qualities, has bad luck.\n\nPurple: 1st princess. A gentle but lonely girl. Queen of orchids.\n\nOrange: 2nd princess, Younger sister villainess type. Orange rose.\n\nNavy: royal maid, retainer, professional loafer.\n\nMaroon: professional assassin, retainer, common-sense girl.\n\nBrown: cafe maid boss, coffee girl.\n\nOpal: music composer and theatre girl. Reckless type.\n\nAnything is fine! \n\nThank you very much for your time!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tg-HEjnr8RJ8h-nrW-Um0YfQxp22FEg7", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@satomoriumi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3889079, "client_id": 1810528, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a28201910df8b6f4c04bdc1af33f0811", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a28201910df8b6f4c04bdc1af33f0811, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f8556de3a0ee0c1605ea34e85b8b532 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b43849f9d777d9540f9c81cb47425d2c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba49ba87ad447bb2e5e2b004ff33768d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba49ba87ad447bb2e5e2b004ff33768d, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00c8c5189da787e033e7f6af2fd30437 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b9640e88/uploads/origins/83115c15-f2ff-4456-8409-3e132a2f1dec?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2015ad0ae70207880867e3b237042c48 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\nXでとても可愛いイラストが流れてきてぜひお願いしてみたいなと思いリクエストさせて頂きました！\nVtuberの猫月みお（@Nekozuki_Mio)さんのイラストを描いていただきたいです！\n\n・猫月みおの二次創作ガイドライン\n非営利目的と記載がありますがskebに関しては許可をいただいております https://www.fanbox.cc/@nekozukimio/posts/2642572\n\n・猫月みおさんは現在様々な衣装での活動をされております。\n　本人のツイッターの固定ツイや過去ツイにて当該資料が確認できるかと思いますので添付させていただきます。\nhttps://x.com/Nekozuki_Mio/status/1581492092869562369\nhttps://x.com/Nekozuki_Mio/status/1713607308658487422\n\n\n上記資料を添付しましたがいずれの衣装でも、或いは過度に過激なものでなければオリジナルの衣装でも構いませんが、マスコットの猫ちゃんだけは必須でお願いします。\n（位置は資料に依存せずに自由に配置して頂いて構いません。）\nその他、構図・ポーズ等はすべてお任せで構いません。\n\n〇要望\n・宛名・背景のオンオフができると嬉しいです（キャラ単体の透過差分）\n・（猫月さん本人の）配信のサムネイルやSNS上での告知が出来る、ＦＡとして使用したいです。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@satomoriumi/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3889079, "client_id": 3890044, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnai